nation:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">선배와 후배가 함께 성장하는</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">“2022 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">선배동행</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">사업을 추진하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:123%;margin-left:18.3pt;text-indent:-18.3pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:123%;margin-left:21.5pt;text-indent:-21.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">경기도교육청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">선배동행</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">사업은 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">경기도 초</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">고등학교 졸업생을 선배동행자로 위촉하여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:123%;margin-left:21.5pt;text-indent:-21.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">중학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">고등학생의 교육회복을 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">비대면 멘토링</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">하는 사업으로 귀교에 재학중인 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">생들의 활발한 참여를 희망</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\">합니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:123%;margin-left:21.5pt;text-indent:-21.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:123%;margin-left:21.5pt;text-indent:-21.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림체;\">사업 개요</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:123%;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">사업명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">경기도교육청</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">『</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">2022 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">선배동행</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">』</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:123%;margin-left:102.9pt;text-indent:-102.9pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">모집대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: (</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">멘토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) </span><u><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt